.DS_Store
*.pyc
__pycache__/
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
coverage/
.claude/
.artifacts/
.preview/

# Playwright CLI agent-browser layer (tools/browser-agent/): native skills
# are installed per-checkout by `npm run browser:agent:setup` and are
# regenerable from the pinned @playwright/cli version — never committed,
# same convention as .claude/ above. `.agents/skills/` is that install's
# second official target (alongside .claude/skills/); this repo's own
# `.agents/mcp_config.json` (AgentsRoom's own runtime config, locally
# excluded via .git/info/exclude) is untouched by this narrower rule.
.agents/skills/
# Default snapshot/output location when a Playwright CLI invocation is not
# routed through .playwright/cli.config.json's outputDir — defensive only;
# normal usage writes under .artifacts/browser-agent (already ignored above).
.playwright-cli/

# Рабочие файлы второго инструмента в его зоне: Codex ведёт браузерную
# приёмку скриптами вида `.task17-cdp.mjs`. Они появляются и исчезают по
# ходу его прохода — попадая в коммит Claude через `git add -A`, они
# засоряют историю чужой незавершённой работой (случай 07.08).
docs/audit/verdicts/.*.mjs
.mcp.json
.agentsroom/handoff-transcript-*.txt
.agentsroom/handoff-summary-*.md
